    "faq_dixTqj": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_gCGiga": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much space does it save?",
            "content": "<p>The space saved depends on the model.</p><p>For example, the <strong>TM037</strong> can fold almost flat, with a folded size of <strong>49.21 × 21.25 × 6.1 in</strong>, making it easy to slide under a bed or sofa. 🏡</p><p>The <strong>TM007</strong> uses a hydraulic folding design. Its folded size is <strong>31.89 × 28.74 × 44.1 in</strong>, allowing it to stand vertically and be stored in a corner when not in use.</p><p>Overall, both designs are space-saving, but the TM037 focuses on ultra-flat storage, while the TM007 is designed for vertical folding and heavier-duty use. 👍</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_pWhab4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I store it after use?",
            "content": "<p>For <strong>fully foldable models</strong>, you can fold them flat and slide them under a bed, sofa, or other low spaces using the built-in wheels.</p><p>For <strong>hydraulic foldable models</strong>, you can fold them upright and store them vertically against a wall or in a corner for stable placement.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_YxGyk9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it suitable for small places / apartments?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, it is designed specifically for <strong>small spaces and apartment living</strong>. </p><p>Most models are <strong>foldable and space-saving</strong>, so they can be easily stored after use. They also feature <strong>quiet motors</strong>, making them suitable for shared living environments without disturbing others.</p><p>Whether it’s for a small apartment, bedroom, or home office, they can fit in limited spaces while still supporting daily walking or light workouts.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Yd664w": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to assemble it?",
            "content": "<p>Most models come <strong>95% pre-assembled or fully ready to use</strong>, so setup is very simple.</p><p>In most cases, you only need to attach a few basic parts (like the handrail or tighten a screw), then plug it in and start using it.</p><p>No complicated installation is required, and it can usually be ready within a few minutes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_waLWRW": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it stable for daily use?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, it is built with a <strong>solid steel frame and reinforced structure</strong> to support regular daily workouts.</p><p>It is designed for <strong>walking, jogging, and light running</strong>, with shock-absorbing belts to improve stability and reduce impact during use.</p><p>As long as it is used within the recommended weight capacity, it provides a steady and reliable workout experience for everyday home fitness.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_73DEL4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long is the warranty for WELLFIT products?",
            "content": "<p>All WELLFIT treadmills and walking pads come with a <strong>1–3 year warranty</strong>, depending on the specific model. We stand behind the quality of our products and are here to support you long after your purchase.</p><p>For full details, please visit our official <a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/warranty-policy\"><strong>Warranty Policy</strong></a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_bgFJYG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to pay extra for shipping or taxes?",
            "content": "<p><strong>No, you don't.</strong> All WELLFIT products come with <strong>free shipping and no additional taxes, </strong>consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax</strong>. The price you see on our website is the final price — no hidden fees at checkout.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_pQXUpE": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How soon will I receive my order after purchase?",
            "content": "<p>We ship from <strong>7 U.S. warehouses</strong> located in <strong>California, Georgia, Texas, New Jersey, Houston, and New York. </strong>Most orders are delivered within <strong>1–5 business days</strong>, depending on your location.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
